    issue_1 =
      summary = vctl subproj clone apply subdir
      description =

        When locally cloning a vctl subproj, the subdir specified (if any) should
        be applied in the cabal "packages" specification.  It is currently only
        supplied for a source-repository-package reference.

      severity = high
