    issue_2 =
      summary = vctl rev needs to be vctl specific
      description =

        The "rev" specification is repo-specific; if there is a dgsync repo
        then it attempts to apply the git rev to the darcs checkout.

      severity = low
      severity-reason = reasonable workarounds
      priority = low
      workaround =
        1. Make an identical tag in both git and darcs and use that tag in the =
           EQIL spec.

        2. Make a tag matching the git revision in the darcs repo. =

